# =========================================================
# Agape Website — static HTML/CSS site served by GitHub Pages
# Editors: VS Code, Cursor, JetBrains, Vim | OS: macOS, Windows, Linux
# Lockfiles (package-lock.json, yarn.lock, pnpm-lock.yaml) are
# intentionally NOT ignored so any future tooling stays deterministic.
# =========================================================

